linux.missing_libraries:
Jay can't start: the system is missing libraries needed for the window: {0}.

Install them and open Jay again:
  Ubuntu/Debian: sudo apt install {1}
  Fedora: sudo dnf install {2}
  Arch: sudo pacman -S {3}

On a server without a desktop, use Jay Server instead.

